########## DRY RUN leaves every repo untouched
=== repos_update --dry-run WS/root
behind would fast-forward main by 1
broken fetch failed: fatal: 'WS/origins/does-not-exist.git' does not appear to be a git repository
current up to date
dirty skip: main checked out with uncommitted changes
dirtycurrent up to date
diverged skip: main diverged (ahead 1, behind 1)
legacy would fast-forward master by 1
missing would create main
noremote skip: no origin remote
onmain would fast-forward main by 1
rebasing skip: git operation in progress
worktree skip: main checked out in another worktree

4 updated, 2 up to date, 5 skipped, 1 failed
--- exit=1
########## LIVE
=== repos_update WS/root
behind main SHA → SHA (+1)
broken fetch failed: fatal: 'WS/origins/does-not-exist.git' does not appear to be a git repository
current up to date
dirty skip: main checked out with uncommitted changes
dirtycurrent up to date
diverged skip: main diverged (ahead 1, behind 1)
legacy master SHA → SHA (+1)
missing created main @ SHA
noremote skip: no origin remote
onmain main SHA → SHA (+1)
rebasing skip: git operation in progress
worktree skip: main checked out in another worktree

4 updated, 2 up to date, 5 skipped, 1 failed
--- exit=1
########## LIVE is idempotent
=== repos_update WS/root
behind up to date
broken fetch failed: fatal: 'WS/origins/does-not-exist.git' does not appear to be a git repository
current up to date
dirty skip: main checked out with uncommitted changes
dirtycurrent up to date
diverged skip: main diverged (ahead 1, behind 1)
legacy up to date
missing up to date
noremote skip: no origin remote
onmain up to date
rebasing skip: git operation in progress
worktree skip: main checked out in another worktree

0 updated, 6 up to date, 5 skipped, 1 failed
--- exit=1
########## a repo root acts on itself, not its subdirectories
=== repos_update WS/root/onmain
onmain up to date

0 updated, 1 up to date, 0 skipped, 0 failed
--- exit=0
########## argument handling
=== repos_update --bogus WS/root
repos_update: unknown option: --bogus
usage: repos_update [-n|--dry-run] [directory]
--- exit=2
=== repos_update WS/root extra-arg
repos_update: unexpected argument: extra-arg
--- exit=2
=== repos_update WS/nope
repos_update: not a directory: WS/nope
--- exit=1
